{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "8e2f0f6b-4a5c-4f0d-9c1b-1a2b3c4d5e6f",
    "name": "SoftTech HelpDesk Service",
    "description": "Colección de pruebas para el microservicio reactivo de gestión de incidencias (HelpDesk).\n\nBase URL: {{base_url}} (por defecto http://localhost:8080)\nAutenticación: JWT Bearer (variable {{token}})\n\nRoles disponibles:\n  - CLIENTE (crear y cerrar tickets)\n  - SOPORTE_TI (asignar, investigar y resolver)\n  - ADMIN (acceso completo)\n\nFlujo sugerido:\n  1. Crear ticket (guarda automáticamente ticket_id y ticket_number)\n  2. Asignar -> Iniciar investigación -> Resolver -> Cerrar con CSAT\n\nEjecutar la app: ./mvnw quarkus:dev",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          ""
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": "PEGAR_AQUI_EL_JWT"
    },
    {
      "key": "ticket_id",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "ticket_number",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Ciclo de vida",
      "description": "Flujo completo: Crear -> Asignar -> Iniciar investigación -> Resolver -> Cerrar.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Crear ticket",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const response = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (response.id) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('ticket_id', response.id);",
                  "}",
                  "if (response.ticketNumber) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('ticket_number', response.ticketNumber);",
                  "}",
                  "pm.test('Status es 201', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "pm.test('Cuerpo contiene id', () => pm.expect(response.id).to.exist);",
                  "pm.test('Estado inicial OPEN', () => pm.expect(response.status).to.eql('OPEN'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"title\": \"Database timeout in payroll batch\",\n  \"description\": \"PostgreSQL deadlock detected during concurrent payroll execution in ERP-RRHH.\",\n  \"priority\": \"HIGH\",\n  \"erpModule\": \"HUMAN_RESOURCES\",\n  \"requesterId\": \"USR-CORP-98421\",\n  \"vipCustomer\": true\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/tickets",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "tickets"
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Asignar ticket",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"assignedAgentId\": \"AGT-TI-5042\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/tickets/{{ticket_id}}/assign",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "tickets",
                "{{ticket_id}}",
                "assign"
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Iniciar investigación",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [],
